     "prompt": "Find the exact value of $\\sin240^\\circ$.",
     "answer": {
      "short": "$-\\dfrac{\\sqrt3}{2}$",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}240^\\circ&\\text{ is in the third quadrant, where sine is negative}\\\\\\text{Reference angle}&=240^\\circ-180^\\circ=60^\\circ\\\\\\sin240^\\circ&=-\\sin60^\\circ=-\\frac{\\sqrt3}{2}\\end{align*}$$"
